{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "b895b3bb-3748-8b90-b2b2-4cdc289a24ea",
  "created_at": "2025-12-29T10:18:44-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Esteban Cordero",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Rosa Delgado",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:17:36-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Rosa. Buenos días, good morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:17:39-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, good morning, good morning. Um, I am calling for the library, the Newport library. Is this the library?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:17:45-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, this is the City Clerk at City Hall. You've got the wrong number, but that's okay. Which library were you looking for, the main one on Spring Street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:17:53-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes, the main one. I have this number in my phone, from, um, a list. An old list. I think the list is older than my truck, you know? [pause] So the numbers, they walk away."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:18:03-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It happens. Numbers change all the time. Do you have a pen, or are you driving?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:18:08-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I am driving, yes, but slow. I have the window a little open, for the air, so if the wind is loud, I am sorry. I want to ask them about the hours, because of the holiday week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:18:18-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Easiest thing is to search Newport Public Library online once you park, and the current number and holiday hours will be right there. I can't give you the number off the top of my head without being sure it's current."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:18:29-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, okay. So I look on the internet, the Newport Public Library. Not the old list."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:18:34-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Exactly. Not the old list."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:18:36-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Rosa. You are very kind. Sorry for the trouble, and good day to you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:18:41-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No trouble at all. Drive safe, and happy new year."
    }
  ],
